{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meg's Monster: Lost Memories is a collection of short prequel adventures that expand upon the world and lore of Meg's Monster by letting players experience the heartwrenching backstories of five wholly unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An MMA fighter who steps into the ring to earn money for his ailing brother's medical treatment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl whose bickering parents seem eerily on edge about her upcoming fifth birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unseen creature in a dark cell, created for the sole purpose of killing a specific human being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man reborn after death as a monster, who devotes his newfound life to bringing order to the Underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monster child, raised in a laboratory and subjected to extensive experimentation\u2014but to what end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five lives. Five stories, heretofore untold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet all beg the same underlying questions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a monster be just as human as a human?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And can a human be more monstrous than a monster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Estimated Play Time: Around 2 hours)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790820?t=1762417049","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790820/d13389a433fdd1ea4e42148ac61cf1e6e10f31f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762417049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790820/d08421ee2cdfa98bccf091d341e07f5a575e8835/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762417049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790820/d08421ee2cdfa98bccf091d341e07f5a575e8835/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762417049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meg's Monster: Lost Memories is a collection of short prequel adventures that expand upon the world and lore of Meg's Monster by letting players experience the heartwrenching backstories of five wholly unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An MMA fighter who steps into the ring to earn money for his ailing brother's medical treatment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl whose bickering parents seem eerily on edge about her upcoming fifth birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unseen creature in a dark cell, created for the sole purpose of killing a specific human being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A man reborn after death as a monster, who devotes his newfound life to bringing order to the Underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A monster child, raised in a laboratory and subjected to extensive experimentation\u2014but to what end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five lives. Five stories, heretofore untold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet all beg the same underlying questions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can a monster be just as human as a human?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And can a human be more monstrous than a monster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Estimated Play Time: Around 2 hours)</p>","developers":["Odencat"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1783360","name":"Meg's Monster"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790820/83d681d03e3791b7d6dbc3ae3d8fba6426ebbf6b/header.jpg?t=1762417049","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommen